    <!-- 2026-09-20: a fully transparent background was tried first (per the
         icon's own design) but rendered as opaque black on every device and
         launcher tested (with or without Nova) — a real Android platform
         behavior (many launchers flatten/cache adaptive icons against an
         opaque canvas rather than true alpha compositing), not fixable by
         adjusting this resource further. Settled on the app's own dark
         palette (ui/CLAUDE.md background token) as the deliberate fill
         instead, confirmed correct via aapt2 dump of the actual compiled
         resource, not just the source file. -->
    <color name="ic_launcher_background">#0d0f14</color>
